# Design Document Branch Rule

All design documents (`docs/design/*.md`) live on the `wip-docs` branch.

When creating or editing design documents:

1. Switch to the `wip-docs` branch before making changes
2. Stash any unrelated working-tree changes on the current branch first
3. Commit design docs to `wip-docs`
4. Switch back to the original branch and restore the stash

When the user asks a design question that will produce a document, write it directly on `wip-docs` without being asked.
